<title>USA: American Industrial opts not to buy property.</title>
<headline>American Industrial opts not to buy property.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Industrial Properties REIT said on Tuesday it has elected not to proceed with the purchase of an industrial property in San Antonio, Texas.</p>
<p>The company's decision not to buy this property resulted in the return of $1.5 million in mortgage financing proceeds which had been held pending the anticipated purchase of the property, the company said.</p>
<p>An American Industrial Properties spokesman said the trust found other better investment opportunities elsewhere.</p>
</text>
